1 NOTE {geni:about_me} It is not certain whether Haoldus de Burnen belongs to this genus, which was first documented around 1140. On 3 November 1264 Theodoricus de Bornem appears in the Havelland document. The certain family line begins 
2 CONC with Klaus von dem Borne. Reference: Borne (Adelsgeschlecht)
2 CONT
