1 NOTE {geni:about_me} a.d.H. Gr. Küssow  (from the noble house of Gross Küssow) After the death of her second husband, she continued to live on her estate at Brotzen (Broczyno). http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Broczyno
2 CONT
2 CONT Had a brother named Samuel von Oesterling, whose occupation was Domprobst (Provost of a Cathedral) in Kolberg. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents:
2 CONT
2 CONT Elisabeth Theophila von Küssow (Antonie (al. Katharina) Luise von Hagen5, Anna Ursula von Ketelhack4, Ursula Katharine von Bredow3, Ursula von Bardeleben2, Siegmund von Bardeleben1) was born 1700, and died 1736. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel von Oesterling, son of Ernst Christian von Oesterling and Elisabeth Tugendreich 19-201 von Wedel. He was born 24 Jul 1700, and died BEF 1752.  Occupation: Herr auf Küssow, Domprobst zu Kolberg
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources: 1) Information Dirk Peters 2) Nachrichten... 
2 CONT
2 CONT --------
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel's parents:
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Ernst Christian von Oesterling b: 28 Jan 1646 in Iglau Mother: Elisabeth Tugendreich 19-201 von Wedel b: 28 Sep 1681
2 CONT
2 CONT Elisabeth's parents:
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Johann (Berend) Christoph von Küssow b: 27 Nov 1667 in Küssow Mother: Antonie (al. Katharina) Luise von Hagen b: 12 Jun 1681
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT http://geneagraphie.com/getperson.php?personID=I520677&tree=1  
2 CONT
2 CONT The Geneagraphie.com record for Sophia and her husband, which seems to be based on several published genealogical source books, gives us more information about Sophia.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sophia Elisabeth von Oesterling was born 28 Feb 1729, and died after 1803. She was the daughter of Samuel von Oesterling and Elisabeth Theophila von Küssow b. 1700. 
2 CONT
2 CONT In addition to her first son Casimir / Kazimierz (not mentioned in the german sources but confirmed by Casimir's baptism record), whom she would have given birth to at age 15, Sophie Elisabeth and husband Christian Heinrich Günthe
2 CONC r von der Goltz had the following documented children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Margarethe Henriette von der Goltz,   b. 1750,   d. date unknown
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Heinrich Samuel Gottlieb Günther von der Goltz,   b. 6 Mar 1751,   d. 31 Mar 1816 
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Ernst Sigismund Wilhelm von der Goltz,   b. 27 Mar 1752, Lüben d. 27 Jun 1816, Consbruch
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. Luise Eleonore Dorothea Marie von der Goltz,   b. 1755,   d. 1829 
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. Carl August Johann Gottlieb Siegmund von der Goltz,   b. 1761,   d. 1851
