1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Karl Philipp von Unruh''' ''(AKA: Carl Philipp)''
2 CONT was born on March 6, 1731 in Crossen/Oder . His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34656709331 Ludwig Philip von Unruh] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34656709370 Christiane Eleonore de Bruyn]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Karl Philipp married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34656709261 Elisabeth Henriette Dorothea von Kameke]. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-1697184 Dorothea Christiane Modeste von Unruh] (*1781 - †1854). 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on September 30, 1805 in Bayreuth . 
2 CONT ''(Biography generated on 21 Mar 2024)''
