1 NOTE {geni:about_me} NST 1976, Vol 25 nr. 3, s. 208-241. Per Seland: Hr Hans Jørgensen Gotzow i Undal 
2 CONT
2 CONT Kongelig Majestets befalingsmann over Utsten klosters len.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Kilde:''' [https://web.archive.org/web/20140807090135/http://vigerust.net/tore/adel/likpreken_teiste1660.html Likpreken Teiste 1660]
2 CONT
2 CONT Reference: Book
