2 CONT
2 CONT Sørhelle 1 hud
2 CONT
2 CONT I tillegg kom setegardene Hananger og Lunde
2 CONT
2 CONT in 1618. He died in 1624 at Hananger, Lista, Vest Agder, Norway. He is mentioned Nes I. 345. Lista II. 435 Hans Theiste
