1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Wałcz - 2392, 2544, 2548, 2927, 2959, 2987, 2988, 3000, 3156   //  Lord and Heir of Brotzen (Broczyno), Lüben (Lubno), Appelwerder and Altenwalde (now Liszkowo (Szczecinek), Koszalin, Poland). Married: Jan 1725.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT http://geneagraphie.com/getperson.php?personID=I602286&tree=1
2 CONT
2 CONT Geneagreaphie.com record, which seems to be well documented from several published historical sources, states:
2 CONT
2 CONT Günther Johann von der Goltz  born 27 Dec 1697, Lüben died 1749, Brotzen married 1725 to Dorothea von Borcke (born before 1700, died before 1752) (daughter of Wolff Jürgen von Borcke and Ilsa Sophie von Podewils) children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Christian Heinrich von der Goltz,   b. 9 Dec 1725, Brotzen  d. 1770, Deutsch-Krone (Age 44 years)
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Juliana Maria Luise von der Goltz,   b. 1728,   d. Bef 1749  (Age 21 years)
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Otto August von der Goltz,   b. 1732,   d. 1791  (Age 59 years)
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. Maria Eleonore von der Goltz,   b. 1733,   d. Aft 1749  (Age 17 years)
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. Esther Dorothea Ernestine von der Goltz,   b. 1734,   d. 1750  (Age 16 years)
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources listed at Geneagraphie.com include:
2 CONT
2 CONT [S5788] GHdA, Freiherren A Bd. II, Bd. 13 der Gesamtreihe, Ehrenkrook, v., Hans Friedrich (Hauptbearbeiter), (C. A. Starke Verlag, Glücksburg Ostsee 1956), 173 (Reliability: 3).
2 CONT
2 CONT [S4115] Nachrichten Über die Familie der Grafen und Freiherren von der Goltz, 1885 - 1960, Hans Gerlach v. d. Goltz unter Mitwirkung von Kurt Frhr. V. d. Goltz und Dr. Joachim Frhr. V. d. Goltz, (Bibliothek Familiengeschichtlcher 
2 CONC Arbeiten - Band 27, Verlag Degener & Co, Neustadt an der Aisch, 1960), Tafel N (Reliability: 3).
2 CONT
