1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Some people list this Marianna with the maiden name Rogalińska, but this seems to be a speculation. I have not seen this stated in any printed and published genealogy reference materials. The published reports, inc
2 CONC luding her actual death record recovered on microfilm from the church (Mostki, k. Mąkolna), as well as the death record of her son Adam, do not mention her maiden name. Simply "spouse of Golcz."  So it appears that even at the tim
2 CONC e of her and her son's deaths, on these official documents, her maiden name was not used, for whatever reason.
2 CONT
2 CONT Death record at this link: http://www.geneteka.genealodzy.pl/index.php?op=gt&lang=pol&bdm=D&w=15wp&rid=D&search_lastname=Golcz&search_name=Maryanna&search_lastname2=&search_name2=&from_date=&to_date=
